      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fresno_County%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "North Fresno boasts over thirty historic sites, such as the iconic Fresno Water Tower that once stored 250,000 gallons.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
