      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fresno_County%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early settlers faced relentless floods and devastating fires, with blazes in 1882 and 1883 wiping out entire city blocks.",
