      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fresno_County%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Moses Church pioneered irrigation by digging “Church Ditches,” turning the valley into a wheat‑producing powerhouse.",
